Runtime dependencies (installed separately, not bundled)
--------------------------------------------------------

pypdfium2 (BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0) ships a PDFium build that includes
FreeType (FreeType Project License), libjpeg-turbo (IJG / BSD-3-Clause),
OpenJPEG (BSD-2-Clause), Little CMS (MIT), libpng, zlib, ICU (Unicode),
Abseil (Apache-2.0) and Anti-Grain Geometry 2.3; see its license files.

The invisible-text font is generated at runtime by pdf_layer.GlyphLessFont
with fontTools (MIT); no font program is shipped for it.
